# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## Project Overview

PLM-IQ — a full-stack data browsing and retrieval application for Product Lifecycle Management (PLM) data. Features:
- **Data layer**: Structured PLM data (BOMs, cost sheets, engineering change orders, AML/AVL, CAD metadata) stored in SQLite
- **Web application**: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + Jinja2 server-side rendered UI with Bootstrap 5 dark theme
- **Unstructured documents**: PDF spec sheets per part generated from CSV data
- **Corpus**: Built on a bicycle PLM synthetic corpus with an archive enterprise-scale corpus for testing retrieval at production scale

